# Component indices synchronization

Component index artifacts must stay aligned with the component docs:

- `docs/components/*.md`
- `docs/components/overview.md`

## Required behavior

- Any pipeline command that updates component docs/spec/proof metadata must keep `overview.md` coherent with the component pages.
- Do not leave `overview.md` out of sync after a capture/import flow.
- If the overview write fails, restore the docs state to the pre-run snapshot.

## Scope

- Applies to: `ds:capture-visual-proof`, `ds:capture-from-url`, and markdown-to-Figma workflows that mutate component status metadata.
- May be used by other scripts as a finalization step when they modify component artifacts.
